  "description": "Cha-Min is an A-list actor with a talent for reading lines — AND people’s thoughts. Mo-Gyum is an actor getting his career back on track after a mysterious accident left him scarred as a kid. The relentless Cha-Min can’t read scene-partner Mo-Gyum's thoughts at all, making him all the more intriguing... He can't get in his head, but that doesn’t stop him from trying to get inside his body. After all, they're just rehearsing the drama... The scenes heat up as the clothes come off between these two! \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
